sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Person
    participant EG as Envoy (SecurityPolicy)
    participant KS as keycloak-service:8443 (internal)
    participant KP as sso.qa.disasterproject.com (public)
    participant A as App X

    Note over EG,KS: on policy load: discovery and JWKS<br/>via backendRefs to the internal Service
    U->>EG: GET https://x.qa.disasterproject.com
    EG-->>U: 302 to the public authorization_endpoint
    U->>KP: /realms/qa/protocol/openid-connect/auth
    Note over KP: redirector → Entra ID (see 04)
    KP-->>U: 302 with code
    U->>EG: /oauth2/callback?code=…
    EG->>KS: token endpoint (internal back-channel, internal CA TLS)
    KS-->>EG: id_token · access_token (iss = public URL)
    EG-->>U: session cookie · 302
    U->>EG: GET with cookie
    EG->>A: request + token header
    alt Keycloak down
        EG-->>U: error (fail-closed, DK6)
    end
